# Production-only: serve the picker dirs (test-models / test-patterns) from
# jsDelivr off the public GitHub repo instead of the deploy origin. Read by
# Vite (bundle URLs) and by scripts/trim-dist.mjs (drops the dirs from dist).
# Not a secret — a public CDN base. Dev has no .env.production → local paths.
#
# Form: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<ref>/<repo-path-to-public>
# Pinned to the fix-no-chroma branch; the compressed .webp must be committed
# and pushed there, and the repo must be PUBLIC, before jsDelivr serves them.
VITE_ASSET_CDN=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/dongxiangz8866-commits/mockup-fe@fix-no-chroma/app/public
